<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261102094000 +0000" stop="20261102100500 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Sarah Shark</title>
    <desc lang="fr">Sarah travels to one of the top 10 dive destinations in Australia (Julian Rocks, Byron Bay, NSW) to dive with three species of Wobbegong Sharks within the Cape Byron Marine Park. She also conducts a street poll with members of the public to find out what they think about sharks.</desc>
