<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261102132500 +0000" stop="20261102135500 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Journeys in India</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Mysore: The Rebel Kingdom</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">Journeys explores the history and fables that surround the controversial rebel leader Tipu Sultan. Mysore was the center of an Empire strong enough to challenge the British. Tipu's over-the-top personality is reflected in the architecture, gardens and stories that still permeate this metropolis.</desc>
    <category lang="fr">Documentaire</category>
