    <title>Wildbound by Forloh</title>
    <desc>In this episode Andy and his friend Scotty take on Kodiak Island, Alaska for an adventure of  Salmon fishing and hunting black tail deer. Whilst traversing steep mountains in the company of Kodiak brown bears and taking on cold Alaskan waters, Andy presents useful information for fellow outdoor enthusiasts all whilst building friendships with the great people of Kodiak Big Timber Lodge.</desc>
  </programme>
  
